    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: save recordings + voicemail to text\n\nCopies each voicemail and phone recording from Twilio into Supabase storage, and types voicemails out with Groq.\n\nNo passwords in this workflow. Credentials used:\n- **CommunityConnect dispatch secret** (Header Auth) on the first step.\n- **Twilio account** on Download from Twilio.\n- **Groq (voicemail to text)**: Header Auth, Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer ` + your Groq key (console.groq.com → API Keys).\n- **Supabase** on the Supabase steps.\n\nTo use OpenAI instead of Groq: change transcribeUrl and transcribeModel in Config (recordings), and the Value of the credential to `Bearer ` + your OpenAI key.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -480
